    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/5ae58327a3e842ca655d9490384c7b6f.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Manson Moss, a schizophrenic man who sees everyone with an inanimate object for a head. Due to a certain 'incident', he is sentenced to mandatory rehabilitation in one of New York's most ill-managed psych wards in the year of 1986. He plots his escape, but the eccentric occupants of the Ward can't let him leave\u2014so they get a little friendly with him instead. Help Manson navigate love, psychosis, and countless misadventures in this dark comedy visual novel, Object Ward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 male and 2 female love interests &amp; a friendship route. Homo/Hetero/Bisexual adult content can be turned off in settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">21 endings with choices that matter. Over 160k words of an unforgettable story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horrible puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partial voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique CGs and a fully original soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/556a021781291ebf015f5cdb93eeb507.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/6d1d7e2dd89c655a89fb80f6f0099018.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/5ae58327a3e842ca655d9490384c7b6f.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Manson Moss, a schizophrenic man who sees everyone with an inanimate object for a head. Due to a certain 'incident', he is sentenced to mandatory rehabilitation in one of New York's most ill-managed psych wards in the year of 1986. He plots his escape, but the eccentric occupants of the Ward can't let him leave\u2014so they get a little friendly with him instead. Help Manson navigate love, psychosis, and countless misadventures in this dark comedy visual novel, Object Ward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 male and 2 female love interests &amp; a friendship route. Homo/Hetero/Bisexual adult content can be turned off in settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">21 endings with choices that matter. Over 160k words of an unforgettable story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horrible puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partial voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique CGs and a fully original soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/556a021781291ebf015f5cdb93eeb507.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730500/extras/6d1d7e2dd89c655a89fb80f6f0099018.avif?t=1745008835\" /></div></p>",
